ISO-10303-21;
/* Gp119 - Cylinder seam-edge pcurve ambiguity
 * Defect: ShapeFix_Edge.FixSameParameter — edge on cylinder's seam (u=0 or
 * u=2π). FixSameParameter's pcurve handling at seam parameter is ambiguous:
 * pcurve can parameterize as either u=0 or u=2π, causing parameter mismatch. */
